  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raising awareness of inclusive crafts: building capacity and self-sufficiency of communication within the Charity SAFOD and the Countries of SA.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project working to support disabled artists and practioners in Southern Africa through increased awarness of Inclusive crafts and Assitive Technology resources. Benefits regional artistic/practioner communities, NGOs and policy makers. SDGs 8,10</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
